<title>USA: Schroder Wertheim names Kaufthal vice chairman.</title>
<headline>Schroder Wertheim names Kaufthal vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co Inc, a subsidiary of Schroders PLC, said Thursday it named Ilan Kaufthal vice chairman.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman said Kaufthal filled a vacancy that was created when Peter Schoenfeld resigned in September, 1996 to start his own business.</p>
<p>Schroder Wertheim said Kaufthal joined the company as a managing director in 1987 and has been a member of its executive committee since 1989.</p>
</text>
